WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:06.910
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and back in my
Korra Book 3 teaser breakdown I asked you

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:10.600
all to submit questions so I picked 10 of
them with one bonus question to answer in

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.600
a video.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:16.400
I also wanted to talk a little about the Nickelodeon
upfronts that are coming March 13th, because

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.869
that might be when we get our first official
look at Book 3.

00:00:19.869 --> 00:00:23.240
If you’re finding me for the first time
and you’re a big Korra fan or just anime

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:25.289
in general be sure to subscribe to get all
my stuff.

00:00:25.289 --> 00:00:30.199
I typically do anime videos on a semi-weekly
basis and I do regular Korra videos, especially

00:00:30.199 --> 00:00:31.369
during the season.

00:00:31.369 --> 00:00:33.399
So first let’s talk about the upfront.

00:00:33.399 --> 00:00:38.160
It’s just when Nickelodeon screens stuff
from all of it’s upcoming shows for advertisers

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.300
so that they buy advertising time.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:44.620
During that it’s widely rumored that they’ll
screen new footage from Korra Book 3 and reveal

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:46.680
the official premiere date.

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:50.340
If you’ve seen any of my other Book 3 videos
you know I’m expecting it to premiere either

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:54.400
late in the spring, like as soon as April
or at the latest, the beginning of summer

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.400
in May.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:59.440
They’re almost done animating Book 3, and
usually that’s the cue that the premiere

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:00.630
is really really close.

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:05.680
The first official Book 3 trailer typically
comes a month or two ahead of the premiere

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:06.680
too.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:09.840
It’s not exact, but if they do post the
official trailer in March, you can bet we’ll

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:11.950
see book 3 in April or May.

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:14.080
So now let’s answer some questions.

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:19.790
Number 1 - KJ Bucane asks Do you think there
will be any MAJOR character deaths in this

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:21.060
upcoming season?

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:25.140
Yes, I think I think it’s kind of been implied
that Katara will die.

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:28.320
They’ve brought together the children of
Aang and I don’t think it’s just because

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:29.550
they look cool together.

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:33.659
They spent all of book 2 healing their relationship
and dealing with their issues.

00:01:33.659 --> 00:01:38.299
The next logical step now that they’re so
unified would be to introduce a major tragedy

00:01:38.299 --> 00:01:40.310
that they could deal with together.

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:43.340
And what could be more tragic for their family
than their mother dying?

00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:47.690
To be fair though, if she does die, she did
live a very fulfilling and happy life with

00:01:47.690 --> 00:01:51.840
Aang and look at all her children all grown
up.

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:56.630
Question 2 - Soraya Moolchan Since they'll
be in the fire nation at one point, I want

00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:59.960
to know if we'll be seeing Zuko!

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:06.340
That person on top of the dragon this White
Lotus member is talking to has a face scar

00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:07.409
and is about the right age.

00:02:07.409 --> 00:02:09.539
I think it’s safe to predict he’ll play
a role.

00:02:09.539 --> 00:02:11.730
Hopefully he will be helping team Korra.

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:16.840
But we really need an official trailer with
more scenes to be sure.

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:21.840
Question 3 - Tommy Shen says either the White
Lotus are helping Korra or they’re a corrupt

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:22.840
faction.

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:26.810
Yes, I think it’s safe to say the White
Lotus itself is still a good group.

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:30.990
They’re not evil, but whoever the ones Korra
was fighting with in the trailer were, they

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:35.500
were probably just a faction or people impersonating
White Lotus members.

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:40.350
Someone else in the comments, sorry I forgot
who, suggested that the villain this season

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:43.900
could have planted evil agents inside their
ranks.

00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:49.300
Question 4 - Holiday Flower Girl asks So if
the Fire Nation is gonna be in book 3, is

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:53.100
there a possibility that we might actually
see Zuko’s daughter, the Fire Lord?

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.709
I will be so disappointed if we don’t see
her.

00:02:55.709 --> 00:02:57.130
We still don’t even know her name.

00:02:57.130 --> 00:03:01.610
Which is one of the things I love about authors
like George RR Martin and JRR Tolkein.

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:05.710
They have massive appendices at the ends of
their books with every person’s name going

00:03:05.710 --> 00:03:07.599
back several generations.

00:03:07.599 --> 00:03:08.599
Even if they don’t appear in the book.

00:03:08.599 --> 00:03:09.599
To be fair to the Avatar creators, for every
one book say George RR Martin writes.

00:03:09.599 --> 00:03:10.599
They have made almost four seasons of Korra.

00:03:10.599 --> 00:03:11.599
They’re starting to animate book 4 right
now.

00:03:11.599 --> 00:03:12.599
Considering all that yes, I definitely think
we’ll finally meet her.

00:03:12.599 --> 00:03:16.660
I think the real thing to consider is, does
she take after her father, her mother who

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:19.690
is probably Mai or her aunt Azula.

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:24.099
Zuko probably wouldn’t have let her become
the new Firelord if she was crazy like Azula

00:03:24.099 --> 00:03:25.099
though.

00:03:25.099 --> 00:03:29.849
Question 5 - Izzy Goggin asks Is Korra going
to ride it the dragons?

00:03:29.849 --> 00:03:33.120
If Zuko and Aang got to ride Roku’s dragon,
who was in spirit form.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:38.470
Then yes I definitely think Korra will get
to ride...finger’s crossed...Zuko’s dragon.

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:41.959
Even if that person in the trailer isn’t
Zuko, I still think she’ll get to ride one

00:03:41.959 --> 00:03:42.990
at some point.

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:48.209
There will be several fantasy characters riding
dragons this year.

00:03:48.209 --> 00:03:53.380
Question 6 - Winged Zero 101 asks Since they're
including scenes from the Fire nation next

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:57.379
season, do u think that they'll tease us with
a brief appearance from Azula?

00:03:57.379 --> 00:04:00.519
Zuko and his daughter are on high alert watch.

00:04:00.519 --> 00:04:06.680
I’d say that Azula, who will always be linked
with Zuko like Mako and Bolin, will probably

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:08.099
also make a brief appearance.

00:04:08.099 --> 00:04:11.069
It really depends on what they’re doing
in the Fire Nation.

00:04:11.069 --> 00:04:14.230
If they only travel their briefly, then chances
are slim.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:18.209
But the more the story revolves around the
Fire Nation as a geographical location.

00:04:18.209 --> 00:04:20.750
The better the chances we’ll see her.

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:24.100
Because the story is supposedly mostly based
in the Earth Kingdom though, I think they’ll

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:25.960
spend most of their time there.

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:30.880
Question 7 - The Majestic Cousins asks Do
you think that will it be another Avatar series

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:32.560
after Korra?

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:37.720
Bryan Konietzko and Michael Dante DiMartino
typically take about 18 months to two years

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:41.770
to develop and produce a season of Korra.

00:04:41.770 --> 00:04:46.470
They said they really want to take a break
after book 4 airs.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:50.661
So if they want to do another new series and
Nickelodeon wants to pay for it, yes to the

00:04:50.661 --> 00:04:52.080
new Avatar.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:56.280
But there would be a long time between Korra
Book 4 and Book 1 of whatever the new series

00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:57.280
was.

00:04:57.280 --> 00:04:59.970
Assuming they don’t start writing it immediately
after book 4.

00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:04.270
I would plan on the comic book mostly filling
in any period there’s no new Avatar.

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:08.230
It’s a lot easier to produce that a season
of television.

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:12.000
Question 8 - direncgeil (no avatar) asks What
happened to vaatu?

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:14.160
and is he supposed to return?

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:18.330
So based on Raava and Vaatu’s cycle of death
and rebirth, Vaatu will slowly grow out of

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:20.470
Raava over the next ten thousand years.

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:21.470
Asterisk.

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:26.190
I don’t think he’s supposed to come back
before the end of book 4, but theoretically

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:31.100
someone could do the same thing Jinora did
during the finale to bring him back sooner.

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:36.510
Remember she helped Korra extract Raava from
Vaatu before she grew powerful enough by herself.

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:41.040
They don’t really have gender, but she’s
voiced by a woman, so I choose to use that

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:42.040
pronoun.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:48.630
We can talk more about the mechanics of that
in the comments.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:52.210
Question 9 - gaberoid asks Will we get more
toph in book 3?

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:55.150
Yes, but probably mostly in Flashbacks.

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:59.490
Although on the show they haven’t explicitly
said Toph is dead.

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:04.770
The other characters exclusively refer to
her in past tense and Katara said that many

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:06.479
of my friends are gone.

00:06:06.479 --> 00:06:11.660
Zuko, of course, we know is still alive.

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:16.380
But yes, lot’s of Beifong backstory coming,
which paves the way for lot’s of Toph with

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:17.940
Baby Beifong flashbacks.

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:19.570
So get excited for that!

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:24.540
Question 10 - Kaitlyn Li asks Is asami going
to be featured heavily in Book 3?

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:27.190
Yes, she and Korra aren’t frenemies anymore.

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:29.120
They’re going to be super buddies.

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:33.400
I’m sure Tumblr will create the most epic
of ‘ships based on their scenes.

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:36.980
Like I said, there will be much less teen
romance, love triangle whatnot.

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:43.650
Meaning it will be easier for Korra and Asami
to be friends.

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:48.389
Bonus Question - Vantastic asks Since the
avatar connection is broken between korra

00:06:48.389 --> 00:06:52.310
and the past avatars, will aang still be able
to make a cameo?

00:06:52.310 --> 00:06:55.319
Yes, but just like Toph probably only in Flashbacks.

00:06:55.319 --> 00:06:59.069
The children of Aang are all there, so they’ll
also probably invoke a lot of Aang moments

00:06:59.069 --> 00:07:01.139
themselves in addition to Korra.

00:07:01.139 --> 00:07:04.910
Thanks so much everyone for submitting questions,
this was a lot of fun as always.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:08.590
Hopefully there will be some better news about
Book 3 in the next two weeks.

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:13.539
Until then leave your suggestions for what
you want me to do my next Korra video on.

00:07:13.539 --> 00:07:14.840
